#.  FAQ
#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_1_title"
msgid "How can I remove the holidays imported via the \"Add holidays\" button?"
msgstr ""
"How can I அகற்று the holidays imported வழிமம் the \"Add holidays\" button?"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_1_text"
msgid ""
"Holidays created that way are inserted in a new calendar called "
"\"Holidays\". You can go in Settings -> Manage calendars, long press the "
"given calendar and delete it by selecting the trashbin."
msgstr ""
"Holidays உருவாக்கப்பட்டது that way அரே inserted in a புதிய நாள்காட்டி called"
" \"Holidays\". You can go in அமைப்புகள் -> Manage calendars, long press the "
"given நாள்காட்டி and delete it by selecting the trashbin."

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_2_title"
msgid ""
"Can I sync my events via Google Calendar, or other service supporting "
"CalDAV?"
msgstr ""
"Can I sync my நிகழ்வுகள் வழிமம் Google Calendar, or மற்றொன்று பணி supporting"
" CalDAV?"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_2_title_extra"
msgid "Maybe even share calendars with other people?"
msgstr "Maybe இரட்டை பங்கு calendars with மற்றொன்று people?"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_2_text"
msgid ""
"Yes, just toggle \"CalDAV sync\" in the app settings and select the "
"calendars you want to sync. However, you will need some third-party app "
"handling the synchronization between the device and servers. In case you "
"want to synchronize a Google calendar, their official Calendar app will do "
"the job. For other calendars you will need a third-party sync adapter, for "
"example DAVx5."
msgstr ""
"Yes, just toggle \"CalDAV sync\" in the பயன்பாடு அமைப்புகள் and தேர்ந்தெடு "
"the calendars you want பெறுநர் sync. However, you will need some third-party"
" பயன்பாடு handling the ஒத்தியக்கம் between the device and servers. In case "
"you want பெறுநர் synchronize a Google calendar, their official நாள்காட்டி "
"பயன்பாடு will do the job. க்கு மற்றொன்று calendars you will need a third-"
"party sync adapter, க்கு example DAVx5."

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_3_title"
msgid "I see the visual reminders, but hear no audio. What can I do?"
msgstr ""
"நான் காட்சி நினைவூட்டல்களைப் பார்க்கிறேன், ஆனால் ஆடியோ கேட்கவில்லை. நான் "
"என்ன செய்ய முடியும்?"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_3_text"
msgid ""
"Not just displaying the actual reminder, but playing the audio is hugely "
"affected by the system too. If you can't hear any sound, try going in the "
"app settings, pressing the \"Audio stream used by reminders\" option and "
"changing it to a different value. If it still won't work, check your sound "
"settings, if the particular stream isn't muted."
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_4_title"
msgid "Does the app support time zones?"
msgstr "Does the பயன்பாடு support time zones?"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_4_text"
msgid ""
"Yes, it does. By default all events are created in your current time zone. "
"If you want to change an event's time zone, you will first have to enable "
"the time zone picker at the app settings, then change it at the Event "
"Details screen. It is disabled by default as most people won't need it."
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_5_title"
msgid "The app shows no notifications, why is that?"
msgstr "பயன்பாடு எந்த அறிவிப்புகளையும் காட்டவில்லை, அது ஏன்?"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_5_text"
msgid ""
"Check your device battery and notification settings, if there is nothing "
"blocking the reminders, or killing the app in the background. You might also"
" want to take a look at <a "
"href=https://dontkillmyapp.com>https://dontkillmyapp.com</a>, it has some "
"useful tips."
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_6_title"
msgid "How can I modify or delete an existing calendar?"
msgstr ""

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_6_text"
msgid ""
"You can do both of those in the app Settings - Manage calendars. Just click "
"on the wanted one for changing the label and color, or select the wanted one"
" by long pressing it and use the trashbin at the top menu for deleting."
